affiliated with, authorized by, or endorsed by Fractal Audio Systems.
"Axe-Fx", "Fractal Audio", and related names are trademarks of Fractal Audio
Systems and are used here only for identification and interoperability.

The data was captured on firmware 32.02 and is provided "as is", without
warranty of any kind. Parameter IDs, model IDs, and value scales can change
between firmware versions. Sending SysEx to hardware can alter presets and
persistent settings; see SAFETY.md. Use at your own risk.
